OL,3,GNEWSAUnwanted campervan lands starring
OL,4,Arole in music video
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campervan which was not a hit with
OL,7,Fother neighbours living nearby has
OL,8,Fbecome the star attraction of a new
OL,9,Fmusic video.
OL,11,FThese Wicked Rivers said the RV had
OL,12,Firritated locals in Belper, Derbyshire
OL,13,F- but was the "perfect" prop for their
OL,14,Fnew single Rise.
OL,16,FThe band left a "nice old-fashioned
OL,17,Fnote" on the windscreen and the owner
OL,18,Fagreed to lend them the vehicle for the
OL,19,Fshoot. He has since moved the vehicle
OL,20,Fout of the town.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
